   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Our facility will also support the growth and development of a black African-owned business that has been qualified for both BOLD (Black Ownership &amp; Leadership for Development), and 2X as an organisation that has a gender focus at the core of its business through senior leadership representation, customer base target and product design. The investment aims to enable a path to asset ownership for drivers in Nigeria while allowing them to earn an income, supporting greater economic opportunities via decent work (SDG 8.5). In the absence of Moove in the market, it is highly unlikely that most of the targeted population would be able to earn enough, or access the credit needed, for them to acquire their own car.</narrative>
   </description>
